        "text": "The target is Eurostat table sts_copr_m, exact series sts_copr_m.M.I21.SCA.PRD.F.EA20: total construction for EA20, calendar and seasonally adjusted, 2021=100. The resolver is the May 2026 first print, not a growth rate or later revision."
